    "description": "OBSERVED FEATURES & INVENTORY\nMineral Hardness Kit:\nEducational mineral specimen collection arranged in a compartmented display tray.\nGeoscience Industries Materials:\nIncluded reference sheet marked \"Geoscience Industries Ft. Collins, CO.\"\nMohs Scale Reference Guide:\nPrinted sheet titled \"Hardness: A Property of Minerals\" explaining the mineral hardness scale.\nNine Mineral Specimens:\nNine numbered mineral specimens present in individual compartments.\nSpecimen Labels:\nMineral samples carry numbered identification stickers corresponding to the hardness scale.\nDisplay Tray:\nWhite molded tray with individual specimen compartments.\nPresentation Box:\nBrown hinged storage/display box included.\nReference Specimen Capsule:\nSmall clear plastic capsule containing a tiny specimen is included in one compartment.\nVaried Mineral Types:\nCollection includes translucent, crystalline, opaque, and colored mineral specimens representing different hardness levels.\nSchool Markings:\n\"B.L. Garza Middle School\" stamp visible inside the box lid.\nDimensions:\nApproximately 7.25\" x 5\" x 1.5\".\nWeight:\nApproximately 0.52 lbs.\nPERCEIVED FLAWS & CONDITION NOTES\nUsed Educational Set:\nEvidence of prior classroom, educational, or collection use.\nSchool Ownership Markings:\nSchool stamp present inside the box lid.\nPaper Wear:\nInstruction sheet exhibits light creasing, curling, and handling wear.\nBox Wear:\nPresentation box shows scuffs, edge wear, corner wear, and storage-related imperfections.\nTray Dust:\nMinor dust and mineral residue visible in several compartments.\nLabel Wear:\nNumber stickers show minor wear and aging.\nNatural Mineral Imperfections:\nSpecimens display natural fractures, inclusions, uneven surfaces, and color variations inherent to mineral samples.\nSpecimen Identification Unverified:\nIndividual mineral identifications have not been independently verified beyond the included numbering system and reference sheet.\nCompleteness Not Guaranteed:\nSet appears populated with nine specimens as photographed, but original factory completeness cannot be confirmed.\nStorage Wear:\nLight rubbing and handling wear visible on specimens and packaging components.\nUsed AS-IS:\nItem is offered in used condition as pictured. Only the mineral specimens, capsule, box, tray, and instruction sheet shown in the photographs are included.",
